<title>UK: Hamleys H1 pre-tax profits rise 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Hamleys H1 pre-tax profits rise 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 27</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.7		    vs 5.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.0		    vs 2.7</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.0		    vs 1.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   11.4		   vs 11.0</p>
<p> Operating result	 1.8		    vs 1.5</p>
<p> Pay date		   n/a</p>
<p>Div  registration date n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - British toy retailer Hamleys Plc said current trading is ahead of the same period of last year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom - +44 171 542 4019</p>
